    "body": "Owned execution carrier for a current-main characterization of `delete_all_documents()` with pending uncommitted deletes.\n\nPinned base: `1f32c1a8af0eb9d68bd3f5576caf20941364b657`.\n\nThe primary probe manually synchronizes `IndexWriter::committed_opstamp` after each successful commit so the separate upstream issue #2666 cannot explain the result. It then reproduces the pending-delete / delete-all / re-add sequence and records whether the re-added document is deleted. Two controls cover delete-all without pending deletes and an already-committed delete.\n\nCarrier-only assets at rest; CI materializes a private `cfg(test)` module. No upstream contact or mutation.",
